{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10372","headline":"登百丈峰二首 二 · 高适","name":"登百丈峰二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晋武轻後事，惠皇终已昏。\n豺狼塞瀍洛，胡羯争乾坤。\n四海如鼎沸，五原徒自尊。\n而今白庭路，犹对青阳门。\n朝市不足问，君臣随草根。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}